        "t_142": "07. Request a quote",
        "t_143": "> LOADING BROADCAST BARCELONA NODE...",
        "t_144": "YOUR BUSINESS HAS STORIES TO TELL <br/> <span class=\"text-signal-red\">AND WE MAKE THEM SOUND</span>",
        "t_145": "<strong>CHUS BZN</strong> is an audiovisual and technology production company in Barcelona. We help SMEs and brands communicate like the big ones: corporate video, ads, live streaming, sound and AI content, with the closeness of a local studio.",
        "t_146": "<span>REQUEST A QUOTE</span>",
