        "t_161": "AUDIOVISUAL STUDIO IN BARCELONA",
        "t_162": "// OUR WORK, LIVE",
        "t_163": "Projects & Reels",
        "t_164": "Video, music and live shows for brands of every size. Step in and see the real quality of the work, backed by three decades of craft.",
