        "t_203": "v1.0.0 Stable // Electron + React",
        "t_204": "<strong>Your post-production, on-premise:</strong> a single application unites video editing, image processing and broadcast-grade mastering.",
        "t_205": "v1.0.0 Stable // FastAPI + FFmpeg",
        "t_206": "<strong>Professional colour and formats in an instant:</strong> cinema LUTs, colour grading and delivery for any platform, in record time.",
        "t_207": "v1.0.0 Stable // LLM Multimodal",
        "t_208": "<strong>The soundtrack of your business:</strong> sound identity, voice-overs and commercial playlists tailored to your shop or brand.",
