        "t_245": "// PROFESSIONAL CURRICULUM & CAREER",
        "t_246": "Professional Curriculum & Track Record",
        "t_247": "30+ years of craft in film, television, sound and audiovisual technologies, today applied to the communication of SMEs and brands.",
        "t_248": "// MANIFESTO",
        "t_249": "We were born in Barcelona's urban culture (BZN MCs) and today we are an audiovisual and technology studio for businesses. That energy lives on in every project.",
        "t_250": "We have worked in film, live television, advertising, dubbing and streaming for major broadcasters and platforms, and we bring that experience to your project with the closeness of a local studio.",
        "t_251": "All work includes legal clearance and author rights (SGAE, AISGE, AEDYP, AIE) and is delivered ready to use: technical sheets, MEO and public liability insurance. You communicate, we take care of the rest.",
        "t_252": "AUDIOVISUAL SYSTEMS MANAGEMENT & AI INTEGRATION",
        "t_253": "// HISTORY OF PROJECTS & PRODUCTIONS",
        "t_254": "33 Year Industrial Timeline",
        "t_255": "Senior Producer & IA Specialist",
        "t_256": "Actuara12 (Owner Studio & Laboratory)",
        "t_257": "Technical leadership in AI-assisted film productions, CCU control and proprietary software design (Studio Pro Suite, Cine Station Pro).",
        "t_258": "Solutions architecture and high-level technological consulting for the creative and corporate audiovisual sector of Barcelona.",
        "t_259": "Sound Designer & Editor",
        "t_260": "Sound design for \"Dinàmiks\" (TV3) and musical editing for national top-rated entertainment formats such as \"Juego de Ninos\" (TVE1) with Javier Sardà.",
        "t_261": "Dubbing and post-production of feature films (The Lord of the Rings trilogy) and television series (American Horror Story, CSI) for Netflix, HBO, Amazon Prime and Sony Pictures.",
        "t_262": "General technical direction of the first professional freestyle battles organized in nationally renowned venues such as Razzmatazz. Coordination of multimedia filming.",
        "t_263": "1990 - 2006 (16 Years Owner)",
        "t_264": "Musical Editor & Direct Sound",
        "t_265": "Direct sound control and effects during the 8 consecutive seasons of \"Crónicas Marcianas\", the historical leading television program in Spain.",
        "t_266": "Operation with pure industrial analog technology: 35mm systems, open tape multitrack recorders and analog time code.",
        "t_267": "// OFFICIAL GENERALITAT ACCREDITATION OF CATALONIA",
        "t_268": "FPCAT Qualifications (14 Competency Units)",
        "t_269": "<strong class=\"text-white\">UC1408_3:</strong> Definition and planning of complex sound projects for audiovisual and direct.",
        "t_270": "<strong class=\"text-white\">UC1409_3:</strong> Supervision of installation and maintenance of professional sound systems.",
        "t_271": "<strong class=\"text-white\">UC1410_3:</strong> Equipment adjustment and sound capture for recording or broadcast broadcast.",
        "t_272": "<strong class=\"text-white\">UC1411_3:</strong> Post-production of sound projects (mixing, sound design and EBU R128 mastering).",
        "t_273": "<strong class=\"text-white\">UC1412_3:</strong> Verification and adjustment of sound systems in complex venues.",
        "t_274": "<strong class=\"text-white\">UC1413_3:</strong> Sound control in performing arts and live mass events.",
        "t_275": "<strong class=\"text-white\">UC1396_2:</strong> Programming and assembly of live musical and visual animation sessions.",
        "t_276": "<strong class=\"text-white\">UC1397_2:</strong> Live musical mixing and animation with lighting and video.",
        "t_277": "<strong class=\"text-white\">UC1398_2:</strong> Live visual animation integrating scenic elements.",
        "t_278": "<strong class=\"text-white\">UC1402_2:</strong> Assembly, disassembly and maintenance of professional AV equipment.",
        "t_279": "<strong class=\"text-white\">UC1403_2:</strong> Direct mixing and recording in live sound productions.",
        "t_280": "<strong class=\"text-white\">UC1404_2:</strong> Microphony and spectral positioning in sound.",
        "t_281": "<strong class=\"text-white\">UC0928_2:</strong> Digitization and digital processing of images.",
        "t_282": "<strong class=\"text-white\">UC1401_1:</strong> Assembly of professional photographic products.",
