        "t_service_podcast_specs": "<strong>Solution & Deliverables:</strong><br/>• Ready-to-use setup (microphones, camera and lighting): you talk, we record.<br/>• Broadcast-grade editing, mixing and mastering + short clips for social media.<br/>• <strong>Application:</strong> your own channel that positions you as a reference in your sector.",
