        "t_163": "Progetti & Reels",
        "t_164": "Video, musica e dirette per brand di ogni dimensione. Entra e verifica la qualità reale del lavoro, con il supporto di tre decenni di mestiere.",
        "t_165": "<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"p-3 bg-signal-red/20 text-signal-red rounded-lg group-hover:bg-signal-red group-hover:text-white transition-colors\"><svg class=\"w-8 h-8\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M23.498 6.186a3.016 3.016 0 0 0-2.122-2.136C19.505 3.545 12 3.545 12 3.545s-7.505 0-9.377.505A3.017 3.017 0 0 0 .502 6.186C0 8.07 0 12 0 12s0 3.93.502 5.814a3.016 3.016 0 0 0 2.122 2.136c1.871.505 9.376.505 9.376.505s7.505 0 9.377-.505a3.015 3.015 0 0 0 2.122-2.136C24 15.93 24 12 24 12s0-3.93-.502-5.814zM9.545 15.568V8.432L15.818 12l-6.273 3.568z\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-signal-red uppercase font-bold\">GUARDA I VIDEO →</span></div><div><h3 class=\"font-headline text-2xl text-white uppercase group-hover:text-signal-red transition-colors\">Canale ufficiale YouTube</h3></div>",
        "t_166": "<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"p-3 bg-signal-red/20 text-signal-red rounded-lg group-hover:bg-signal-red group-hover:text-white transition-colors\"><svg class=\"w-8 h-8\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M17.77 10.32l-1.2-.5L18 9.06c1.84-.96 2.53-3.23 1.56-5.07s-3.24-2.53-5.07-1.56L6.2 6.57C4.7 7.36 3.8 8.95 3.84 10.65c.04 1.7 1.01 3.23 2.54 3.96l1.17.53L6 15.94c-1.84.96-2.53 3.23-1.56 5.07.96 1.84 3.23 2.53 5.07 1.56l8.28-4.14c1.51-.79 2.48-2.38 2.44-4.08-.03-1.7-1.01-3.23-2.46-4.03zM9.5 15.5v-7l6 3.5-6 3.5z\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-signal-red uppercase font-bold\">VEDI CORTOMETRAGGI →</span></div><div><h3 class=\"font-headline text-2xl text-white uppercase group-hover:text-signal-red transition-colors\">YouTube Shorts</h3></div>",
